### Scale L1 — Cooperation group
A small set of units collaborating on a subgoal or bounded problem. It exchanges intermediate results and maintains a local semantic projection. It can resolve local disagreements when the relevant authority and evidence are within its scope.

Group contract:
- own a defined subgoal and dependency set;
- publish summarized results plus links to supporting evidence;
- detect disagreement and escalate unresolved authority conflicts;
- avoid broadcasting every low-value internal event globally.
